Description: A 'shiny' application for the stability analysis of
    multi-environment trials of plant breeding with the package 'stability':
    analyses of variance, Eberhart and Russell's and Finlay and Wilkinson's
    regression, Wricke's, Shukla's, Kang's and Fox's statistics, Eskridge's
    safety-first indices, Annicchiarico's, Lin and Binns' and Huehn's
    statistics, AMMI analysis
    and stability values, and the GGE biplot. Every analysis comes with its
    tables, plots, the R code that repeats it and an interpretation specific to
    the method, computed from the results; an optional longer written
    interpretation can be requested from an external text service with the
    user's own key.
